{"4112070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "An Eggstremely Hard Game", "steam_appid": 4112070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two geese. One fragile egg. Infinite chaos.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to carry it through unpredictable challenges without breaking it, every crack makes it harder, every mistake more hilarious. A co-op physics game about teamwork, clumsiness, and the unstoppable power of honking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/25f8488ba1db8fda3581de9730ee6462.poster.avif?t=1787166617\" width=612 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/25f8488ba1db8fda3581de9730ee6462.webm?t=1787166617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/25f8488ba1db8fda3581de9730ee6462.mp4?t=1787166617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cracks = Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every <strong>crack</strong>, the egg becomes <strong>harder</strong> to control and easier to lose. Each impact makes it wobblier, bouncier, and far more unpredictable. Handle it carefully, or watch it explode <strong>in a glorious mess</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/a029842a9c62890dd96fd457cfd41056.poster.avif?t=1787166617\" width=612 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/a029842a9c62890dd96fd457cfd41056.webm?t=1787166617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/a029842a9c62890dd96fd457cfd41056.mp4?t=1787166617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Not all is lost</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the egg <strong>slips away</strong>, you can still <strong>recover</strong> it. Every fall is a chance to try again. Fragile, cracked, but never truly broken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/796ebde78b87f7e830e7683ad9957c33.poster.avif?t=1787166617\" width=612 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/796ebde78b87f7e830e7683ad9957c33.webm?t=1787166617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/796ebde78b87f7e830e7683ad9957c33.mp4?t=1787166617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Teamwork at its finest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up your useless partner, throw them back on track, and pretend you didn’t almost drop them on purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/d68652ecb41ed239f2e41291a1ca0d94.poster.avif?t=1787166617\" width=612 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/d68652ecb41ed239f2e41291a1ca0d94.webm?t=1787166617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/d68652ecb41ed239f2e41291a1ca0d94.mp4?t=1787166617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One egg, endless chaos</strong> – Keep it safe (or try) through unpredictable physics and tricky obstacles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cracks that change everything</strong> – Each hit makes the egg weaker and the game harder.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teamwork and betrayal</strong> – Lift, toss, honk, and sometimes sabotage your partner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-fueled fun</strong> – Clumsy controls and goose energy combine for hilarious moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A true test of patience</strong> – Rage, laugh, and celebrate every inch of progress.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two geese. One fragile egg. Infinite chaos.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to carry it through unpredictable challenges without breaking it, every crack makes it harder, every mistake more hilarious. A co-op physics game about teamwork, clumsiness, and the unstoppable power of honking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/25f8488ba1db8fda3581de9730ee6462.poster.avif?t=1787166617\" width=612 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/25f8488ba1db8fda3581de9730ee6462.webm?t=1787166617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/25f8488ba1db8fda3581de9730ee6462.mp4?t=1787166617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cracks = Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every <strong>crack</strong>, the egg becomes <strong>harder</strong> to control and easier to lose. Each impact makes it wobblier, bouncier, and far more unpredictable. Handle it carefully, or watch it explode <strong>in a glorious mess</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/a029842a9c62890dd96fd457cfd41056.poster.avif?t=1787166617\" width=612 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/a029842a9c62890dd96fd457cfd41056.webm?t=1787166617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/a029842a9c62890dd96fd457cfd41056.mp4?t=1787166617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Not all is lost</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the egg <strong>slips away</strong>, you can still <strong>recover</strong> it. Every fall is a chance to try again. Fragile, cracked, but never truly broken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/796ebde78b87f7e830e7683ad9957c33.poster.avif?t=1787166617\" width=612 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/796ebde78b87f7e830e7683ad9957c33.webm?t=1787166617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/796ebde78b87f7e830e7683ad9957c33.mp4?t=1787166617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Teamwork at its finest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up your useless partner, throw them back on track, and pretend you didn’t almost drop them on purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/d68652ecb41ed239f2e41291a1ca0d94.poster.avif?t=1787166617\" width=612 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/d68652ecb41ed239f2e41291a1ca0d94.webm?t=1787166617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/d68652ecb41ed239f2e41291a1ca0d94.mp4?t=1787166617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One egg, endless chaos</strong> – Keep it safe (or try) through unpredictable physics and tricky obstacles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cracks that change everything</strong> – Each hit makes the egg weaker and the game harder.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teamwork and betrayal</strong> – Lift, toss, honk, and sometimes sabotage your partner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-fueled fun</strong> – Clumsy controls and goose energy combine for hilarious moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A true test of patience</strong> – Rage, laugh, and celebrate every inch of progress.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "As highly qualified goose parents, work together to bring your little egg home safely. Every crack makes it harder to control, every mistake more hilarious. A co-op physics game for 2 or 4 players about teamwork, clumsiness and honking. HONK!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Dutch, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/41120